# CLI

- Template packages (`templates/<product>`) export `ScaffoldInitData` (`name`, `prompts`, `templatePath`, `versions`) — data only, no init logic
- `registry.ts` resolves initializers by template name; `--majorVersion` installs `@sitecore-content-sdk/<product>-templates@<major>` on demand
- Pipeline (base prompts, transform) lives in `initialize.ts` + `src/common/`
- Clear prompts and defaults; install dependencies after scaffolding; print next steps
- Backwards compatible arg names; additive changes with defaults

Full detail: [`.agents/docs/AGENTS-workflows.md`](../../.agents/docs/AGENTS-workflows.md#cli-create-content-sdk-app)
